{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0174_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ea560898b1f9d962982fe71da3f470daf22188348e49981b1e405b11efd6e946", "ja": "（今度のドラマで使うジュリアの新しい衣装が届いた。\nスナイパー風の、クールな衣装だけど……）", "zh": "（这次电视剧要用的茱莉亚新服装送到了。是狙击手风格的酷帅服装，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0174_1001_p", "source_sha256": "dca4a83628263b90c1129aef4bb452fa40a0ca36eb74e300ca17b216b0b7e19a", "ja": "ジュリア、新しい衣装はどうだ？\nフィッティングしてみて、違和感とか……。", "zh": "茱莉亚，新衣服感觉怎么样？\n试穿看看，有没有什么不合适的地方……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0174_1002_050jul", "source_sha256": "4d4b9f9fafcbe4606b1f8b7695f3d66b10b76cd41d8862f5506f9669f70f234d", "ja": "そんなもの、あるわけないだろ！\nこの衣装最高だよ、{$P$}！", "zh": "怎么可能有那种东西嘛！\n这套服装棒极了，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0174_1003_050jul", "source_sha256": "f7371d78caa03d5493d372df79acc82409a6ce01771225eee769db13c4ae9c1a", "ja": "スリリングでスタイリッシュ、っていうのか？\n試着しただけで、テンションが上がるくらいだよ♪", "zh": "该说是惊险又时髦吗？\n光是试穿一下，就让人兴奋起来了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0174_1004_p", "source_sha256": "75dc9543e50910f6b1131354e2db2333444579b5f19e42e0b56a660bfb026bba", "ja": "はは、高評価だな！\n気に入ってくれたならよかった。", "zh": "哈哈，评价很高嘛！\n你喜欢就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0174_1005_050jul", "source_sha256": "fdcd99aaef38a2fdfe8b86889ef1c1f716e6d4822c0e94865ad7c76f58386a09", "ja": "ただ、あんまりカッコよすぎるのもな……\nあたしに似合ってるのか、不安になるよ。", "zh": "不过，太帅了也不太好办啊……\n我也不确定，这身衣服是不是适合我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0174_1006_050jul", "source_sha256": "aae45aa187f086cc0665730a9c1da1fc9b0f2559514f3059d2643de181359b0f", "ja": "なあ{$P$}。この衣装、あたしに\n着こなせてるか？　服に着られてる状態じゃなく？", "zh": "喂，{$P$}。这身服装我驾驭得好吗？不是变成被衣服穿着的样子吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0174_1007_050jul", "source_sha256": "1f9613801e9d7c2bc6f5a61a3cb00d3943a1ff8b547f4e3ae862ad02bcf48b74", "ja": "いっそ、あたしがこの衣装に似合うようになるまで\n封印しとくのもアリか……？", "zh": "干脆在我变得配得上这套服装之前，先把它封印起来也不是不行……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0174_1008_p", "source_sha256": "f29e119b281de12fc0fcaeda40e1fce03c509ac81c24e8e7164eed762e3fd4a6", "ja": "いやせっかくの衣装なんだからちゃんと着てくれ……。\nというか、ジュリアにしてはなんだか……。", "zh": "不，难得有这么棒的服装，好好穿上它吧……\n话又说回来，对茱莉亚来说总觉得有些……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0174_1009_050jul", "source_sha256": "9fe012b936b22fe691de049782d1bc88157a46a0b9d0c29130e3c58749460e4c", "ja": "あたしにしては……なんだよ？", "zh": "对我来说……怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0174_1010_p", "source_sha256": "4bda10bd74e8a9c57d7dd360f820c4c8da5258ff42f9afb09d379ef02d706d8d", "ja": "いや。衣装に似合う自分になれるまで\n封印なんて、ずいぶん殊勝なことを言うなって……。", "zh": "不是。只是觉得，在变成适合这套服装的自己之前都要封印起来……你居然会说出这么懂事的话，真是难得啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0174_1011_p", "source_sha256": "8ce6bfef6c10039b0dbc4999c527b04205ee65f1d5a7ea94d7677f889f999c6e", "ja": "いつものジュリアなら、「どんな衣装でも、あたしが\n着たらあたしの色になるんだ！」って言いそうなのに。", "zh": "要是平时的茱莉亚，应该会说：“不管是什么服装，只要穿在我身上，就会变成我的风格！”才对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0174_1012_050jul", "source_sha256": "f1d28f49f335ccd7d6adbfc8ecbb9c09f3b81626f1a937f0731c9e5add5d3318", "ja": "そ、そんなコト言ってないだろ！　……でもまぁ、\n衣装のほうを自分に合わせるって考えはアリだよな。", "zh": "我、我才没说过那种话呢！……不过嘛，把服装调整成适合自己的样子，这个想法倒也不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0174_1013_050jul", "source_sha256": "138c5b094ff997aaeb69a22abc437645c8547fb40db9afcfd3801f18a467a3a4", "ja": "レザーやジーンズも、着古すことで\n自分流に育てていくものだもんな。", "zh": "皮衣和牛仔裤也要靠反复穿着磨合，才能逐渐养成自己的风格。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0174_1014_p", "source_sha256": "e7f0279a649574de598f851db75a7bb48e97f1282293d675d0431a740650d07d", "ja": "うん、そうだな。その考え方はすごくジュリアっぽい。\nロックだと思うぞ！", "zh": "嗯，确实。那种想法很有茱莉亚的风格。\n我觉得这很摇滚！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0174_1015_050jul", "source_sha256": "7e0ba326c7cbb8a8fde18b1a4e3b9780febad613c46beeda922df377cf943faf", "ja": "たしかにな。言われてみれば、そのとおりだ。けど、\nあたしよりも、あたしらしさがわかるなんて……。", "zh": "确实如此。仔细想想，还真是那么回事。不过，居然比我还了解什么才像我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0174_1016_050jul", "source_sha256": "7b3a89a2c02e3d8c9da23ccdada412fc83ec5baf6ed861ebbb59adf9dbc66aac", "ja": "さすがは、あたしのプロデューサーってところか？\nははっ。", "zh": "不愧是我的制作人吗？\n哈哈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0174_1017_p", "source_sha256": "597bb9bb5f786e40e07ba67225c056f5f2cd82f8348f703831824114a9317306", "ja": "ああ。ジュリアの弱気なところもロックなところも、\nちゃんとプロデュースしていくつもりだ！", "zh": "嗯。无论是茱莉亚怯弱的一面，还是摇滚的一面，我都会好好把它们打造出来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0174_1018_050jul", "source_sha256": "e1a636beea6d7b4fbca864fdeb2024e8ae07cd217aad68e3a3fbb6a5fd6e9ff9", "ja": "よ、弱気なところはいいっての！\nったく、このバカP！", "zh": "懦、懦弱的地方就不用管了啦！\n真是的，这个笨蛋P！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0174_1019_050jul", "source_sha256": "4ba7664ad9ac7590c6bd8b6f139756a7166b91ddaf1881b8149dc5f61ba4f5b6", "ja": "だけど、言ったからには責任持てよ？　腑抜けた\nプロデュースしたら、承知しないからな？　ははっ♪", "zh": "不过既然你都说了，就要负起责任来，知道吗？要是敷衍了事地制作，我可不会放过你哦？哈哈♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
